{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":2987369,"ns":0,"title":"Breech-lock","extract":"A breech-lock is a system for mounting camera lenses to camera bodies.  The lens is attached to the camera by means of a rotating ring which is used to tighten the lens to the camera by friction.","description":"Photographic camera system","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}